          <h2>Airport breakdowns and drop-offs</h2>
          <p>A breakdown at Birmingham Airport brings its own pressure — you might be trying to catch a flight, drop someone off, or pick them up, and the last thing you need is a car that won't move in a busy set-down area or car park. We understand the time-sensitive nature of airport call-outs and prioritise getting your vehicle out of the way and to wherever it needs to go, whether that's long-stay parking, a garage, or home.</p>

          <h2>A business-park and exhibition landscape</h2>
          <p>Beyond the terminal, Solihull is one of the region's main business districts, with office parks and logistics sites spread across the borough alongside the NEC's exhibition and events traffic. Car parks here can be large, with multiple access points and site-specific rules, so if you break down on a business park it helps to give us the site name as well as the nearest building or unit number. Many of these breakdowns happen during the working week, often with a vehicle needed back on the road quickly for the next shift or meeting — and when there's a major show on at the NEC, traffic in the area can build quickly.</p>

          <h2>On the M42 corridor</h2>
          <p>Solihull sits directly on the M42, the motorway linking <a href="birmingham.html">Birmingham</a> to <a href="erdington.html">Erdington</a>'s side of the conurbation and on towards the M6 and M40, and a fair number of the breakdowns we attend here happen on or just off that route rather than in the town itself. If you've broken down on the M42 near Solihull, let us know your direction of travel and the nearest junction — the road carries a steady flow of traffic in both directions and getting the approach right matters.</p>

          <div class="callout">
            <p><strong>Dropping off or collecting from the airport?</strong> If your vehicle fails in a set-down zone or short-stay area, move it as far out of the traffic flow as you safely can, put your hazards on, and call us straight away — these areas need to keep moving and we'll aim to clear you quickly.</p>
          </div>
